Z||000000||Zorba||10-15-2000||01:50 PM||||Does anyone have schematics on where these sensors are? Particularly the one that controls the water temp guage? Is this the one on top of the block?||||reg||1
Z||000001||William Federle||10-15-2000||02:12 PM||||I've got a 1984 Fiero with a 2.5 liter engine. On my car, the sensor on the left-hand side of the head pointing to the front of the car is the one that controls the fan.<P>The one on the left hand side of the head pointing straight up is the one that drives the temp gage and lite.<P>The one screwed into the thermostat neck on the left hand end of the head is the one that goes to the ECM.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Zorba||10-15-2000||05:37 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by William Federle:<BR><B>I've got a 1984 Fiero with a 2.5 liter engine. On my car, the sensor on the left-hand side of the head pointing to the front of the car is the one that controls the fan.<BR>  .</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>The one above has a different plug set up too, right? I think i got it. The one pointing straight up is the one I am using.Thx<P>||||reg||10
